      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786248329123,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Uses pub/sub messaging\nsystem to allow you react\nto event and triggrer\nother Azure cloud services\nsuch as Azure Functions.",
